in the morning from Atlanta to D.C.


00:34:40.478 --> 00:34:42.321
You need to be at JFK in an hour


00:34:42.447 --> 00:34:44.324
to catch the last
commuter flight out...


00:34:44.549 --> 00:34:46.551
