connecting flight.


00:34:46.818 --> 00:34:48.320
You've now got...


00:34:49.821 --> 00:34:54.167
sixty-nine...
I mean, fifty-nine minutes, honey.


00:34:54.492 --> 00:34:56.335
You got fifty-nine minutes.


00:34:56.894 --> 00:34:58.669
I'm looking
for the bitch, too!


00:34:58.896 --> 00:35:00.398
Bitch, where are you!


00:35:00.665 --> 00:35:02.838
Could this get any worse?


00:35:08.172 --> 00:35:11.517
Hey, Montana, it's your mother.
Listen.


00:35:11.843 --> 00:35:15.848
Sheree decided to have a
bridesmaid slumber party.


00:35:16.080 --> 00:35:19.926
