Who's the other guy?


00:36:14.639 --> 00:36:16.641
Curtis.
He and Langston are both here.


00:36:16.908 --> 00:36:18.080
I'll get Sam.


00:36:19.911 --> 00:36:20.946
Curtis is here, too.


00:36:21.078 --> 00:36:22.079
You said he got married.


00:36:22.413 --> 00:36:25.758
I thought he did, but I don't think
he is now. No wedding ring.


00:36:25.983 --> 00:36:28.122
None of the married guys I
date wear wedding rings.


00:36:28.186 --> 00:36:29.529
It's tacky.


00:36:30.655 --> 00:36:34.159
Go with Langston. He's running for
Congress, so he needs a running mate.


00:36:36.761 --> 00:36:37.796
Curtis.


00:36:37.862 --> 00:36:38.932
Langston.


00:36:39.096 --> 00:36:40.268
You know Montana?


00:36:40.598 --> 00:36:42.271
Yeah, we're old friends.


00:36:43.100 --> 00:36:46.104
Flight attendants,
prepare the cabin for takeoff


00:36:49.774 --> 00:36:52.778
You know, I'm running
for Congress now.


00:36:53.110 --> 00:36:56.785
And I'm having dinner tonight
with some potentially major...


00:36:56.847 --> 00:36:58.849
campaign contributors.


00:36:59.116 --> 00:37:02.290
Would you know a young lady
- -Gorgeous, intelligent...


00:37:02.520 --> 00:37:05.364
that would be so
gracious as to join me?


00:37:05.623 --> 00:37:06.897
If asked, I might.


00:37:07.024 --> 00:37:08.298
Consider yourself asked.


00:37:08.526 --> 00:37:10.028
Consider yourself answered.


00:37:14.465 --> 00:37:16.809
Right over here, this is me.


00:37:17.635 --> 00:37:21.947
Wow. Langston,
you've done very well for yourself.


00:37:22.006 --> 00:37:26.011
Thank you. This is probably my
favorite room in the house.


00:37:26.477 --> 00:37:27.820
I can see why.


00:37:29.380 --> 00:37:31.053
Oh, you have a dog!


00:37:32.316 --> 00:37:35.320
Montana, this is Juicy.
Juicy, this is Montana.


00:37:35.653 --> 00:37:37.564
She's so cute. Can I pet her?


00:37:40.491 --> 00:37:42.994
Juicy. Stop that, shame on you.


00:37:43.327 --> 00:37:47.776
I'm sorry. She's jealous.
She likes to mark her territory.


00:37:47.832 --> 00:37:50.108
- Sorry about that.
- I understand.


00:37:50.167 --> 00:37:53.671
If you were around more,
Juicy wouldn't have these problems.


00:37:53.904 --> 00:37:57.511
So my being around
more often would be just for Juicy?


00:37:57.842 --> 00:37:59.844
Yes, strictly for Juicy.


00:38:01.178 --> 00:38:05.183
I hope it's okay... I had my assistant
pick you out something to wear.


00:38:05.416 --> 00:38:08.192
I'm assuming your
size is the same as I remember.


00:38:08.419 --> 00:38:09.762
I hope so.


00:38:10.855 --> 00:38:14.200
It's hanging in the bathroom
- -Two doors down to the left.


00:38:14.525 --> 00:38:16.198
Great. Okay.


00:38:16.761 --> 00:38:18.866
Bye, Juicy. We're going to be friends.


00:38:19.196 --> 00:38:21.039
I certainly hope so.


00:38:23.868 --> 00:38:25.211
See you shortly.


00:38:26.037 --> 00:38:27.539
Juicy, pee.


00:38:32.043 --> 00:38:33.784
God, I love that Juicy.


00:38:47.124 --> 00:38:51.129
Montana, allow me to introduce
you to Howard Donaldson...


00:38:51.395 --> 00:38:52.965
and his beautiful wife, Estelle.


00:38:53.230 --> 00:38:56.404
Mr. Donaldson is the owner and
founder of Donaldson Steel...


00:38:56.634 --> 00:39:00.912
