00:39:54.959 --> 00:39:57.633
The lady will also have a
Shirley Temple, extra cherries.


00:39:57.862 --> 00:39:59.864
Oh, no, actually, I'd like a...


00:40:00.131 --> 00:40:01.371
it's okay, I got it.


00:40:02.199 --> 00:40:03.701
A Shirley Temple, please.


00:40:09.807 --> 00:40:14.051
Actually, would you excuse us?
Lam dying to show Montana...


00:40:14.512 --> 00:40:16.924
