view of the atrium.


00:40:16.981 --> 00:40:17.982
Excuse us.


00:40:22.653 --> 00:40:23.996
Sweetheart, listen.


00:40:24.321 --> 00:40:25.682
These are the kind of contributors


00:40:25.756 --> 00:40:29.795
