they're investing in is a leader.


00:40:29.860 --> 00:40:32.204
A take-charge type of man.


00:40:32.263 --> 00:40:34.903
Now, if I sit there
and let you order your own drink,


00:40:34.965 --> 00:40:38.276
then that would be
like you're leading.


00:40:38.335 --> 00:40:39.837
Please, just bear with me.


00:40:40.104 --> 00:40:42.277
I promise, when this
thing is over...


00:40:42.506 --> 00:40:45.953
I'll take you anywhere and you can
