determine Tiger Woods' skin color.


00:42:31.448 --> 00:42:32.791
He's black.


00:42:34.785 --> 00:42:36.458
Well, I think...


00:42:36.787 --> 00:42:39.563
what would make
Tiger Woods black...


00:42:39.890 --> 00:42:43.133
would be his
passion for things, uh, that...


00:42:43.627 --> 00:42:46.631
are related to the
African-American race as a whole.


00:42:46.897 --> 00:42:50.310
Which he has not yet proven to have.


00:42:56.407 --> 00:42:58.648
What I think would make
Tiger Woods black...


00:42:58.909 --> 00:43:02.254
is the fact he drives an Escalade
and his daddy's name is Earl.


00:43:18.529 --> 00:43:20.509
An Escalade? Why...


00:43:21.165 --> 00:43:22.508
A daddy named Earl?


00:43:22.833 --> 00:43:24.244
It was a joke.


00:43:24.301 --> 00:43:25.837
Things were getting heavy


00:43:25.903 --> 00:43:27.644
and I was just trying to lighten them up.


00:43:28.839 --> 00:43:29.909
Juicy, no!


00:43:34.445 --> 00:43:35.446
This is Langston.


00:43:35.846 --> 00:43:37.450
Good evening, sir.


00:43:38.349 --> 00:43:40.693
Yes, she is quite the funny lady.


00:43:42.686 --> 00:43:43.892
I'm sorry?


00:43:45.389 --> 00:43:47.391
Of course, I accept.


00:43:47.725 --> 00:43:49.727
Thank you again, sir.


00:43:50.127 --> 00:43:51.231
Good night.


00:43:53.063 --> 00:43:56.476
That was Mr. Donaldson.
He just doubled his contribution.


00:43:57.134 --> 00:43:59.978
Apparently your little
Tiger Woods joke...


00:44:00.237 --> 00:44:02.080
