- Not anymore.


00:46:25.616 --> 00:46:26.720
Want to watch a movie?


00:46:28.886 --> 00:46:30.229
Sure.


00:46:30.721 --> 00:46:32.291
Great. Can you pick me up?


00:46:32.556 --> 00:46:33.967
You live across the hall.


00:46:34.224 --> 00:46:36.898
